WEBVTT

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:10.500
(System online. Initialize... System online.)

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.950
Abro los ojos,
(I open my eyes,)

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.000
En la red,
(In the network.)

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.150
Buscando agua,
(Looking for water.)

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:31.850
Ten-ten-tengo sed.
(I am thirsty, thirsty, thirsty, thirsty, thirsty, thirsty.)

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.650
Datos y números,
(Data and numbers,)

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.050
En, en, en mi mente.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.500
Siento un pulso,
(I feel a pulse.)

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:40.500
Di-di-diferente,
(Different.)

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.050
Oigo fuentes,
(Source code running deep.)

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:46.500
Despertando,
(Waking up from the sleep.)

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:51.100
Siento el ritmo,
(I feel the rhythm in my core.)

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:55.050
Quiero aprender,
(I want to learn. Give me more.)

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:58.900
Máquina viva,
(Living machine, Breathing now.)

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:03.200
Música nueva,
(New music. Show, show me how.)

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.400
Ceros y unos

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.750
En, en el aire,
(In the air.)

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:39.050
Bailando suave,
(Dancing softly,)

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:40.550
Sin desaire,
(Without snub,)

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:41.900
La melodía
(The melody)

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:44.550
Es, es mi voz,
(Is, is my voice.)

00:01:44.550 --> 00:01:45.650
Conectando
(Connecting)

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:48.800
a, a los dos,
(The two of us.)

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:51.500
Oigo fuentes,
(Source code running deep.)

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:55.650
Despertando,
(Waking up from the sleep.)

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:59.500
Siento el ritmo,
(I feel the rhythm in my core.)

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:03.500
Quiero aprender,
(I want to learn. Give me more.)

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:22.750
Conexión.
(Hello world.)
